WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.500
09:00 — Note a gift. After shopping Saad notes a gift on his phone — who, when, which bottle — so he stops accidentally regifting.

00:00:06.500 --> 00:00:13.000
16:00 — Browse together. Sofa iPad browse with his partner; they laugh at old notes and mark occasions without opening a chat archaeology dig.

00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:19.500
20:00 — Laptop plan. Laptop occasion list for the season; birthdays and dinners planned without relying on memory alone.

00:00:19.500 --> 00:00:26.000
20:30 — Today test. Today on the laptop for the weekend test wear; weather and notes in one calm screen.

00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:32.500
21:00 — Phone. Phone confirms the gift note. He will not buy the same bottle twice for the same cousin.

